@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Library system

actor Member
actor :Librarian: as Lib
actor "Payment gateway" as Pay <<system>>

rectangle "Library system" {
  (Search the catalogue) as Search
  usecase "Borrow a book" as Borrow
  usecase Return as "Return a book"
  usecase (Pay a late fee) as Fee
  (Check membership)
  usecase "Manage the catalogue" as Manage
}

Member --> Search
Member --> Borrow
Member --> Return
Lib --> Manage
Lib -up-|> Member
Borrow ..> (Check membership) : <<include>>
Fee .> Return : <<extend>>
Fee --> Pay
(Reserve a book) --|> Borrow
note right of Fee : Only when the book is overdue
@enduml
